
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Alles ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses

### Eén ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses/1

### Aanmaken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WH001",
  "name": "Rotterdam Warehouse",
  "address": "Havenstraat 10",
  "city": "Rotterdam",
  "zipCode": "3011AA",
  "province": "Zuid-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "frank@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Aanmaken without a field (Code missing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rotterdam Warehouse",
  "address": "Havenstraat 10",
  "city": "Rotterdam",
  "zipCode": "3011AA",
  "province": "Zuid-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "frank@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WH999",
  "name": "Test Warehouse",
  "address": "Havenstraat 10",
  "city": "Rotterdam",
  "zipCode": "3011AA",
  "province": "Zuid-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "frank@example.com",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses/4

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses/999

